SENTINEL R1 Changes
-------------------

New in SENTINEL R1:
- 128 KiB divided into 4 memory banks
- additional LCD displays 40x1 and 16x2
- lower-case letters
- reZet80 custom character splash screen
- RV command (show release version)
- Dino Chase game
- Camel Race game
- Donkey Race game
- Obstacle Runner game
- enhanced Black Jack game
- enhanced Hex Invaders game
- enhanced Asteroid Belt game
- The Lighthouse text adventure
- enhanced Haunted House text adventure

